# Harn the hunter (US-270): starts wary of you, so what he says depends on how you talk.
@who npc-harn

=== start
Harn: What do you want, {hero}?
-> Offer a kind word {opinion npc hero 10; remember npc "{hero} was civil" 15} => kind
-> Mock his aim {opinion npc hero -10} => mock
-> Leave => END

=== kind
Harn: Hm. Fair enough. The deer by the path are skittish, mind.
-> Back => start

=== mock
Harn: Say that again and see what happens.
-> Back => start
